# Asset licensing

- The package ships no third-party art. Demo art is drawn in code or is CC0.
- Default to CC0 packs (Kenney, Ninja Adventure, CC0 OpenGameArt). Each pack lives in
  `demo/public/assets/<publisher>/<pack>/` with its original `License.txt` and gets a row in
  `docs/ASSETS.md` (source URL, licence, date fetched).
- CC-BY / OGA-BY: allowed in the demo only, with a credit line in the demo footer.
- CC-BY-SA, GPL (most LPC art), "personal use only" and Mixamo clips: never add.
- Fonts: SIL OFL via `@fontsource/*` as a demo or user dependency, never bundled into the
  package. Press Start 2P is the default pixel font; Fusion Pixel 12px (TC / SC, OFL) covers CJK.
- Demo video is generated (ffmpeg filter graphs) or CC0, kept under 100 KB per clip, with WebM +
  MP4 sources, a poster, and captions. Never stock footage or ripped game clips.
- Sounds for `gamifiedui-sfx` are synthesised in code; no sample files.
